1
00:00:00,109 --> 00:00:03,319
Oh, no, thanks.
I'm going to the mall with Emma.

2
00:00:08,493 --> 00:00:10,953
(Leonard:)The kid got a girl.

3
00:00:11,329 --> 00:00:13,079
(Raj:)Unbelievable.

4
00:00:13,247 --> 00:00:16,747
(Howard:)Did anyone see how he did it?

5
00:00:17,502 --> 00:00:18,922
(Sheldon(to Gablehouser):)Don't worry, I've got this.

6
00:00:19,087 --> 00:00:23,047
(Sheldon(to Gablehouser):)Ladies and gentlemen,
honored daughters...

7
00:00:23,216 --> 00:00:26,386
(Sheldon(to Gablehouser):)...while Mr. Kim,
by virtue of his youth and naiveté...

8
00:00:26,552 --> 00:00:29,842
(Sheldon(to Gablehouser):)...has fallen prey to the inexplicable need
for human contact...

9
00:00:30,014 --> 00:00:33,854
(Sheldon(to Gablehouser):)...let me step in and assure you
that my research will go on uninterrupted.

10
00:00:34,018 --> 00:00:39,148
(Sheldon(to Gablehouser):)And that social relationships
will continue to baffle and repulse me.

11
00:00:39,774 --> 00:00:40,904
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

12
00:00:41,692 --> 00:00:42,902
[CLAPPING]

13
00:00:43,778 --> 00:00:45,908
- He's back.
- Yeah, mission accomplished.

14
00:00:46,072 --> 00:00:49,322
(Raj:)Forget the mission. How did that
little yutz get a girl on his own?

15
00:00:50,034 --> 00:00:52,244
(Howard:)I guess times have changed
since we were young.

16
00:00:52,411 --> 00:00:54,541
(Howard:)Smart is the new sexy.

17
00:00:55,331 --> 00:00:58,291
Then why do we go home alone
every night? We're still smart.

18
00:00:58,751 --> 00:01:00,381
(Raj:)Maybe we're too smart.

